WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.036 --> 00:00:01.325
- Hi everybody.

00:00:01.325 --> 00:00:03.438
One thing I often hear is
women don't really understand

00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:05.734
how to achieve that natural
look with their makeup.

00:00:05.734 --> 00:00:07.359
So I'm here with my friend Allison,

00:00:07.359 --> 00:00:08.883
and we're going to do a tutorial

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:10.793
on how to achieve that look on your own

00:00:10.793 --> 00:00:11.991
with your own makeup.

00:00:11.991 --> 00:00:15.257
("Flashing Designer")

00:00:15.257 --> 00:00:17.594
The first step is to
start with a pore filler.

00:00:17.594 --> 00:00:20.215
Now we're going to apply a
layer of this all over the face

00:00:20.215 --> 00:00:22.471
because pores this size at her age

00:00:22.471 --> 00:00:24.383
just really aren't natural.

00:00:25.545 --> 00:00:27.191
The next step is all over coverage.

00:00:27.191 --> 00:00:28.654
Now I chose a BB creme

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:30.199
as opposed to a traditional combination

00:00:30.199 --> 00:00:31.397
because it is lighter

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:32.413
and it's going to give a much more

00:00:32.413 --> 00:00:34.303
natural smooth finish.

00:00:34.303 --> 00:00:36.515
- Oh, it tickles.

00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:38.293
- Cover all of that redness

00:00:38.293 --> 00:00:40.015
and all those imperfections.

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.397
Next we're gonna go in with a concealer.

00:00:42.397 --> 00:00:44.428
It's going to give you
that really nice naturally

00:00:44.428 --> 00:00:46.302
airbrushed, Photoshop look.

00:00:46.302 --> 00:00:49.269
You have some dark circles
under the eye, very common.

00:00:49.269 --> 00:00:51.158
Get this little mole here.

00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:52.763
- Actually I really like that mole.

00:00:52.763 --> 00:00:53.962
I think it gives me character.

00:00:53.962 --> 00:00:55.524
- (laughs)

00:00:57.232 --> 00:00:59.818
Now we're gonna seal that
all in with a powder.

00:00:59.818 --> 00:01:01.687
I chose a mineral powder

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:04.804
because it's made with all
natural ingredients and minerals.

00:01:06.035 --> 00:01:07.401
- Where does it end?

00:01:07.401 --> 00:01:09.445
- The next step is to contour the face.

00:01:09.445 --> 00:01:10.908
This is just going to really enhance

00:01:10.908 --> 00:01:13.610
the natural bone structure in your face.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:14.763
So go ahead and

00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:16.388
like a fish.

00:01:17.348 --> 00:01:18.424
You look like a fish.

00:01:20.001 --> 00:01:22.804
You can see it's enhancing
her natural cheekbone.

00:01:22.804 --> 00:01:25.319
Basically we're just going
to reshape your face.

00:01:27.619 --> 00:01:30.301
Alright so now you gotta add the blush

00:01:30.301 --> 00:01:32.470
right on the apples of the cheek.

00:01:33.003 --> 00:01:35.218
This is my favorite part, the eyes.

00:01:35.218 --> 00:01:37.047
Since we are going for our natural look

00:01:37.047 --> 00:01:39.180
I chose the nudes palette.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.105
You can't really get much
more natural than this.

00:01:41.882 --> 00:01:42.918
- There's so many steps.

00:01:42.918 --> 00:01:45.722
- Well, you know it is
hard work to look natural.

00:01:45.722 --> 00:01:47.282
Nobody's born this way.

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:49.176
Now that we've applied the eye shadow

00:01:49.176 --> 00:01:51.045
we're just gonna go in
apply a couple more coats

00:01:51.045 --> 00:01:52.704
of concealer, blush, you know.

00:01:54.984 --> 00:01:56.670
- You're gonna do it all again?

00:01:56.670 --> 00:01:59.104
- Well yeah, you want good coverage.

00:02:00.449 --> 00:02:02.318
The final step for the
eyes is the mascara.

00:02:02.318 --> 00:02:03.619
We're just gonna make those eyelashes look

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:05.869
bigger, fuller, blacker.

00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:07.718
Oh my God.

00:02:08.393 --> 00:02:10.140
Alright so we're gonna put on about

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:11.806
three or four coats of this.

00:02:11.806 --> 00:02:13.147
- What was that?

00:02:13.147 --> 00:02:14.163
That was one coat?

00:02:14.163 --> 00:02:15.281
- That was one coat.

00:02:15.281 --> 00:02:17.069
The final step is the lip.

00:02:17.069 --> 00:02:19.222
It's a really natural nudish color.

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:21.051
So it looks like her skin tone

00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:23.469
only a better version.

00:02:23.469 --> 00:02:26.329
Oh my God, it's so much better.

00:02:27.044 --> 00:02:28.259
Oh my God.

00:02:30.376 --> 00:02:32.286
And just like that, that's all it takes

00:02:32.286 --> 00:02:33.818
to get that natural look.

00:02:33.818 --> 00:02:35.339
- [Allison] I'm probably gonna break out

00:02:35.339 --> 00:02:36.665
from all the makeup on my face,

00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:38.270
but I guess the good news is

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:39.895
is I can just use more makeup

00:02:39.895 --> 00:02:41.094
to cover that up.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:46.094
("Buy now Pay Later")

